<description>&lt;p&gt;Sudan has accused Ethiopia of allowing RSF drones to launch from Ethiopian territory, prompting Ethiopia to expel six Sudanese consular staff and close the Sudanese consulate, while Sudan shut the Ethiopian consulate in response. The UN peacekeeping chief warned that deadly drone strikes are a new and concerning threat to civilians in Sudan. Factories in Sudan are struggling to restart after wartime damage. The conflict caused 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPTlN4Z0NvUnBzSnd0SG9fbUx5Z25Xb19YalJBalpPVHpXZ29BUHJUem9aYTZWZkYwOGZxU1pwRXJvWEMweFhjQ0RIcWcwcHZHdUFIMXRSZHY0ZlZwZXh2bGFvTTJaUTB2OGV4SFdDX3h1YTh0clpIYU1JaWdEMk5LaUVsRlFnbzA2SWhybHR3RGcyemZlZUFj?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE12RzNmdnNRNWJmUWpwdk1VN3lmazV3cnZTN29KMENHRUNJZldMQXlwSl9yYUtmaDZDY0llVUJaMEtYRnJFVmU3WVdzdW5JVUtuQS0wZEJFcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNc1N1NjlSa05wVFlyS1MtcnNUVktKRjlrSDI3TW5wQ1RadVRYNHFJNzdOS2ZRZGw4S1dDa0xJVl9OM2N6QXhFa0psWnFrQzF6aUhUMXZtS283V3NfUC1qdm92MjRBVUlWSGIyRGd2NENwaEFpNUlVSVVVX2ZNZEFxUl9lVUktaVZPQmZ1TC1obXJoWGszUVFBSlZBc3ZaNXFPeW1zZGVjZ3h3ckVwUzdyc0s5UDRSUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
